{"unit_id":"FengHuoLinShan__dsh-plugin-llm-balance#caveat-1","repo":"FengHuoLinShan/dsh-plugin-llm-balance","commit":"7f7be3a4c0e8e42502da1d453665a66dd727283e","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH LLM Balance 查询服务商余额时会向对应的服务商 API 发起请求；需要在 DSH 中配置相应服务商凭据。OpenAI Codex 配额另需安装并完成 Codex Connect 登录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:458-483","lib/index.js:733-761","lib/index.js:799-826"]}
